{
  "0%: whole loaded area. 100%: original camera. Doors and pipes may load another area.": "0%：整个已加载区域。100%：原始镜头。门和管道可能加载其他区域。",
  "A SNES core is already running": "SNES核心已在运行",
  "A detected crown or rotating bezel controls zoom during play and scrolls menus. Sensitivity changes each turn’s effect; Reverse swaps directions. Touch zoom works without a crown.": "检测到的表冠或旋转表圈可在游戏中控制缩放，在菜单中滚动。灵敏度决定每次旋转幅度，反转可交换方向。没有表冠也能触控缩放。",
  "A local SNES collection with an adaptive PC interface and experimental world views. Snes9x supplies the cartridge simulation, including Super FX. No decompilation of every game is claimed.": "本地SNES合集，提供可调整的电脑界面和实验性扩展视图。Snes9x负责模拟卡带，包括Super FX。本项目并未声称已反编译所有游戏。",
  "A personal package includes your local cartridges. Public packages need your own compatible cartridge files.": "个人包包含你的本地卡带，公开包需要你自行提供兼容的卡带文件。",
  "A save slot stores the current machine state. Load returns to it; automatic resume uses its own slot. Battery progress is separate. Replacing a slot requires confirmation.": "存档槽保存当前机器状态，读取可返回该状态，自动续玩使用独立槽位。卡带进度另行保存，覆盖槽位需要确认。",
  "About": "关于",
