  "Choose a floating screen, wall, floor atlas, arcade table, CRT room or curved screen. The same game continues; each mode changes only its spatial presentation.": "选择浮动屏幕、墙面、地板地图、街机桌、CRT房间或曲面屏。同一游戏继续运行，只改变空间呈现方式。",
  "Choose a local cartridge, start a game or open its guide. Public downloads never include the games or your saves.": "选择本地卡带，启动游戏或打开指南。公开下载不包含游戏或你的存档。",
  "Choose button mapping and stick dead zones. A larger dead zone ignores more small movement. Quick controls add camera shortcuts; normal game actions remain available.": "选择按钮映射与摇杆死区。更大的死区会忽略更多微小移动。快捷控制增加镜头捷径，同时保留正常游戏动作。",
