  "On a round watch, the lens bends the whole game rectangle into a circle. Source edges remain visible. Controls and text stay flat; switch it off for an undistorted rectangle.": "在圆形手表上，镜头将整个游戏矩形弯曲成圆形，同时保留图像边缘。按钮和文字保持平直。关闭后显示无变形矩形。",
  "On compatible Quest runtimes, sustained load can reduce peripheral eye-image detail while retaining the center. Menus use a separate sharp layer. Unsupported devices fall back automatically. Physical headset quality remains untested.": "在兼容的Quest运行时中，持续负载可降低眼部图像外围细节并保留中央。菜单使用独立清晰图层。不支持时自动回退到普通渲染。实体头显画质仍未测试。",
  "On-screen keyboard": "屏幕键盘",
  "Open guide": "打开指南",
