  "Open project on GitHub": "在GitHub打开项目",
  "Optional procedural 3D: pixels become solid columns, with terrain, backgrounds and sprites on separate depth bands. Relief is shallow; voxels are thicker. Thickness changes depth, angle changes the desktop view. Automatic quality reduces grid and raster detail under load. HUD and native close-ups keep original pixels. Special scenes fall back to the original screen. This is an interpretation, not a reconstruction of unseen object backs. Physical-device performance remains untested.": "可选的程序化3D显示：像素变成立体柱，地形、背景和角色位于不同深度层。浮雕较浅，体素较厚。厚度改变深度，角度改变屏幕视角。自动画质会在高负载时降低细节。HUD和原始镜头特写保留原始像素。特殊场景回退到原始画面。这是立体化解释，不会还原看不见的背面。实际设备性能尚未测试。",
  "Optional procedural 3D: pixels become solid columns, with terrain, backgrounds and sprites on separate depth bands. Relief is shallow; voxels are thicker. Thickness changes depth, angle changes the desktop view. Automatic quality reduces grid and raster detail under load. HUD and native close-ups keep original pixels. Special scenes fall back to the original screen. This is an interpretation, not a reconstruction of unseen object backs. Physical-device performance remains untested. Rounded shapes generate stepped 3D bodies from sprite transparency; disabling them makes uniform extrusions. Tilt changes the elevation of the screen view. Original positions and game physics stay unchanged. Layer spacing separates depth bands while preserving their order.": "可选的程序化3D显示：像素变成立体柱，地形、背景和角色位于不同深度层。浮雕较浅，体素较厚。厚度改变深度，角度改变屏幕视角。自动画质会在高负载时降低细节。HUD和原始镜头特写保留原始像素。特殊场景回退到原始画面。这是立体化解释，不会还原看不见的背面。实际设备性能尚未测试。 圆润形状根据角色的透明区域生成阶梯状3D实体；关闭后厚度均匀。倾斜会改变屏幕视角的仰角。原始位置和游戏物理保持不变。 层间距拉开各深度层，同时保持叠放顺序。",
  "Options · Esc / View": "选项 · Esc / View",
  "Original 2D": "原始2D",
  "Original camera": "原始镜头",
  "Original cartridge text keeps its original language.": "卡带内文字保留原有语言。",
  "Original code: MIT · Snes9x: noncommercial licence · SDL2/zlib: zlib · Dear ImGui: MIT · font: SIL OFL. The bundled licences and corresponding sources accompany the release.": "原创代码：MIT · Snes9x：非商业许可 · SDL2/zlib：zlib · Dear ImGui：MIT · 字体：SIL OFL。发布包附带许可证及对应源码。",
  "Original framing": "原始画面",
  "Original illustration": "原创插图",
  "Original keeps the console screen. Panorama extends it. Atlas fits available terrain; Full level map reads the entire loaded area where its decoder is supported, including unexplored terrain. Doors can load another area.": "原始视图保留主机画面，全景视图将其扩展。地图集显示可用地形；完整地图在解码器支持时读取整个已加载区域，包括未探索部分。门可能切换区域。",
