  "Switch game? Current progress will be saved automatically when enabled.": "切换游戏？启用自动继续时会保存当前进度。",
  "TV 4:3": "电视 4:3",
  "Targets 60 fps by adapting scenery detail. Game pixels and menus stay sharp.": "通过调整场景细节以达到60帧/秒。游戏像素和菜单保持清晰。",
  "The Lost Levels": "失落的关卡",
  "The backdrop fills empty space around the game. Soft scenery uses sampled game colors; Midnight and Black are quieter choices. Blur and brightness affect this surround.": "背景填充游戏周围的空白。柔和风景采用游戏色彩，午夜和黑色更简洁。模糊与亮度影响这个外围背景。",
  "The game keeps its original SNES clock. View options change presentation.": "游戏保持原有SNES运行节奏。视图设置只调整显示方式。",
  "The locator marks the player; the guide outlines the original camera; the minimap shows its position in the area. A close-up keeps the native screen readable when the map is far away.": "定位标记指出角色，参考框表示原始镜头，小地图显示其在区域中的位置。拉远地图时，近景保留原生屏幕的可读性。",
  "The offline guide could not be opened.": "无法打开离线指南。",
  "The virtual remote, hands and direct touch operate the same game controls. Size and hints affect their usability. Haptic strength changes feedback, without changing button timing.": "虚拟遥控器、手部与直接触碰操作相同的游戏控制。大小与提示改善易用性。触觉强度改变反馈，不改变按钮触发时间。",
