  "Updating a signed APK preserves app data. Uninstalling or clearing app data removes local cartridges and saves.": "更新已签名APK会保留数据，卸载或清除应用数据会移除本地卡带和存档。",
  "Use cartridges you are entitled to use. This independent, noncommercial project is not affiliated with Nintendo. Names identify compatible games. No ROM, artwork, music, extracted level pack or game screenshot is distributed.": "请使用您有权使用的卡带。本项目独立且非商业，与任天堂无关联。名称仅用于标识兼容游戏。不分发ROM、图像、音乐、提取的关卡或游戏截图。",
  "Use several fingers to move, run and jump together. A connected gamepad hides automatic touch controls. Android Back opens the menu.": "使用多指同时移动、奔跑和跳跃。连接手柄后，自动触摸控件会隐藏。Android 返回键打开菜单。",
